{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 900,
  "batch_count": 1655,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "9c226cba1af606e532633417d9bfcf7f7d66a4bf",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96897fcfe81fe12a69b55b1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕。……好了小狗。\\n想知道内容的话，就给我直接回房。听明白了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4cd7b13dcf1da1be0568923efcb5edc7550a11f2bde980a67c911261e0e67ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d666f4712f6c715c0f4a8e48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练已经结束了。\\n我会一边仔细地做着放松运动一边等您的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9bdf3faf4a357d92dc63da884e2ba2bca115ef5126757ed9f03a0e9b656a78a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74709b87efe79310e8d95142",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完成了……然而，修行之路依然漫长！\\n请您指出需要改善的地方！押忍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "feebf21ead196cafc450a4e933c38f27a09c18374daa9f4b152d5589cd7d6813",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:624b8768b77dd832d9c87bee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼……呼……自、自主训练！全部完成了！\\n好想快点给您看看我变强了多——……咳咳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d97072b29776a9ea987b721730b647d9a8c5b7cb9c39044069c204533dc201c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf0f713858b5b7ead5faecd1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦～。在训练员大人\\n到来之前，我会悠哉地等着的～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7704300c00feb443618ca910feba1f6d9ed1a3bbbd2a3e88f4ef5426329c610",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4542a4ce3668522a7b39e1b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完成了！呵呵……没关系的，我并没有\\n勉强自己哦。如果担心的话……就请直接来确认吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "405fb56e0cb95c8e1bbe201a645c7773f17abb33d224416af81cee5d4a215cdc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6ed798a7a3e3b15c0a5e25b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个，自主训练结束了！……我把做得好的地方和\\n不好的地方都记录下来了，请您确认一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b874265b5793b3f0bd9160d35db618f54fae06c52a8e3db6ec5455f7630e8dd9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0303cc2a5ee3d9ae7076e05f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了，此刻，此身宛如乘时之风……\\n微风吹拂的尽头，能请您见证到最后吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "432e6a1542412b0443548292f6cfe1a599d9c14f14f5cf7d07fb0245b01845db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383f0ddcdde8159c9a43696b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，请快点过来……！自主训练做完后，\\n我要应付中央的女孩子们的邀请已经是极限了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f0c6c31f9361ad7e1397d9151cdd8f6d932c174b87e514f97b3ba8f031ea2e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:447cfdf1070877ce8a89c56a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哟。话说，之后去看场电影咋样？\\n那绝对是一部超级B级片！所以，才想和你一起看嘛",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a96319d579b5cd357ee0c52629c5d268c2cf6f3ce64ef8912edfa12a1818ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9256fed8005356a4388d534f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦。这样一来就能把所有人远远甩开了对吧？\\n我现在可是超强的哦！？你这家伙也快点过来被吓一跳吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cda8d36004235cdc436a973e2bef23354afc53812664de87e01386be98d728a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:658515e63697d8fe3ade5481",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我用自己的方式安排了训练内容的自主训练，\\n究竟绽放出了怎样的光辉呢……请一定要来看哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e8e5be2d9a888af5d0dc5506b8965dbeaf3a889da575e19f9e873fdce8465a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7da1e4556ff91c0f8f1c15f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练——完毕。\\n待机中。希望将成果——传达给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c26dd7180718b907ce0e7bba9f12ddfbfaebd8f10b67311a1bd72debbfaec262",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ab5f35035e118acf0003c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵——自主训练……与全新自我的调和非常完美。\\n……来吧训练员。这一杯，可是格外美味的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fb76ff2722ba305dec3546c7362ebb607e9c1e3894187a95a96468128079646",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93edb628f69ceb99d4ac3094",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练顺利完成。在确定接下来的安排之前，\\n我会仔细审视自己应当优先完成的事项。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed9b0c702b692c55e9e57b67f842308da0f5170f220778461ada344a9d184467",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2129588e6a5c52420df4b899",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了。\\n这翻涌而出的爱的去向……能请你快点告诉我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "494e8ac2bd9542a9e269cf3ee2e88d14f0e1dee746ad3ed9f12bf8ec93c9a729",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e48dd1a3a33fdf0583cf141e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咳咳。这里是结束了自主训练，非常了不起的真弓酱哦。\\n我努力的成果，你不来看看吗？……（盯）。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f22c4db1f02cdaead3522a5c74b85c075a564f40d651033d91c91df1ee1c532",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb8a5d886a573e6dbc7d3307",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完成啦♪当然结果是没问题的……我虽然想\\n这么说——但为了以防万一，还是拜托你也检查一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f3982ca0030d7034d013a1b3ab421e7d10590853f3acb2876684c47a380431a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd65097470c816262d30d70b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自、自主训练，结束了……。那个，\\n接下来要做什么……啊，完全不着急的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a608e6785d7f75a3580fc951b86c47f5a737327c86081ef742ddab65041c478",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3829a948384c62a02cf93c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕了。距离配得上『顶点』之名的女王，\\n我究竟靠近了多少……您能来确认一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f99ffef47003e908a276f54ed80958ad9094ba398265d458c042e3e86e340b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1090"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f598e62c3c11907f6dca594",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呐呐，我的自主训练超～级努力了哦♪\\n训练员酱，你有什么话想对我说吧？对～吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac6dd888ee47cae2f4cad26083377e5972073b2a9a41b0984339ff95bc3d375d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4404f027f31e37de682f00e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练，我努力完成了！我想把这化作，\\n一定能赢的……自信。之后的调整也拜托您了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "314e13b18806118435d368bbf92c8a6d032c2178f9032f46d4d9cbeef215cddd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40cac99816d41b763f3f2b66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是自主训练完毕的联络……以及身体状况的报告。没问题，\\n我很有精神。详情就请让我在您有空时向您汇报吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "2783ea5a15e42bee6e9477d42935000a2f33e19a145fa5ef69683de3fc03a5bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54f20ff274ea77e509706e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂——，自主训练做完啦！\\n快点回来啊，我还想补充点甜食呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a7f429ce349c3a73423143e21e43a5c2a9887465c7efe4f359929e34eb31575",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9894289bc3fdff97048d11fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练的部分我已经完成了。为了增添光泽的，\\n最后一道打磨工序……就交给你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75b532d3faa03bdb350cc52b998260a4caa0b73f701a50c936a1850f4605c798",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67a190f406e657f50c770aa6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练讨伐成功～～！！喵哈哈，\\n军师大人也速速前来！让吾展示一下吾的战功吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2599875f63305f67f9cceca698570dfbcdcfbbc7b04a754c1d23ad47f1d9ef0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b3d9938c5b5db6d9301471d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我准备了点心，作为自主训练后的加餐。\\n那个……如果您不介意的话，要不要一起吃呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6afabd29de2c9709e34f32d62308d989445785e6cf59d7fbcb6ba301753a8e17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b326e08dfad1b502d6cbdfd7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在吉位完成了自主训练！这样幸运（Lucky）就完美啦☆\\n接下来只要你过来，那快乐（Happy）也就完美了吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dd623341bac1c42596fa446adb3e890f3ccc4555f7cba3a93e5036558806d26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1cc1ce1e5141fc6f24878ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次自主训练的结果，我稍后整理好发给您哦。\\n我也希望能得到您的建议……就拜托您协助啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d32dea47d54a2c5dee67ff3344e7cc85dbb120e5c95be9ea6861ea9dd4a5ed4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2635e9a03ae89af50ba79ee9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦。要不要泡杯昆布茶\\n呢♪呵呵，我也会把你的那份准备好的哦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fb94352faa8dde3121db9372b1b148504a465f1e8d52d57345362fb196da14b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8172ecaafa0d6ee16e8585f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练，终曲……！啊啊，化作了一曲美丽的\\n练习曲哦……大概是因为想着你而演奏的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a814d29620a3b0e900a244fd3995b5bf377ea8c39b19bea15610299dabd95fb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe6f6b3df1cab6df84459336",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练虽然完成了……但也差不多该采取措施\\n应对千篇一律了吧……。能尽快拜托你定个新菜单吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "043fc94723dcca6b57d61804dd6b4c31af3bd7b61da8f29148b36a434256c6a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:321a85df69c9e81af4e3e81a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂——，还在忙吗？你也挺努力的嘛。\\n自主训练已经做完了，一起去喘口气休息一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e80cfb3e0b78df7aef652fe05988f66322d1a0694ad96a90573b35531e7bf1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:293fff69c912595c930f187c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『自主训练』，完毕。为了共享“探查结果”，\\n“PORT”——也就是说……『来见我』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6daa64c126e1d9fdbbbeab1ffa37eb9ab09b4b1a33e36e0807e2c199fd5fbdf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4bf824cb0372e1493f0afcb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼～自主训练做完啦～。我很了不起对吧？\\n很了不起的吧？请一定要好好来夸奖我哦——。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3c8c6b8f2e2452a481ad911fbf68131e12dba01c517f01803b0ff06cfc06d3c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48a8c3a96b1e3a205ef75433",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在自主训练中流了些好汗，心情大好的船长回来啦！\\n那么，能夸奖我让我情绪更高涨的航海士大人在哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1adba6e662e3a4f3644a6e8e02e9c993d541645c4e66992f1ffb7f319d00ccef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c021651a721b5f60ebfe05aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了。我想与你共享成果。\\n在等你的这段时间——我就做做肌肉训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "460b7295065dfe33b511e0f2944b2dee48a11de0fac4bba6b68a80e5c68f0d73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cdf47580f183a38572198c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好——，自主训练结束！……那个！我是不是\\n更接近出色的王冠赛马娘了呢——能请您看看吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "547f2829dae00d13a2da3a121eb6d4ccecd08f257d1140b16d9b59821dc189ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11b55e0b61f526c48cfe4561",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练，已全部顺利完成了——\\n呵呵……♪因为想被您夸奖，就不由得努力过头了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3621cd2d94c6136c4ef3dedb235544e664263f40f5fdcd43cbe707014a652f81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5ed8d6dfc51475fb16d39a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "预定的自主训练已全部完毕。\\n接下来请您确认训练成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06c7f650b6ca9cf653cab75dc5da3e2bf57909c62695b29246b993d56c30da98",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbe8bc75235efab6cb580d59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦！呐，不马上来见我吗？\\n让我展现给你看看，My queenly radiance♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0fe0fd504beb3cd21ecfb2af25a21e0ab7d8f6aa0c2ff4301eee08e11d1ced",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e21ebd741b11ac67376e340",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇哈～～～～！自主训练，结束啦～！！\\n我超级～努力了……作为奖励，拜托给我平时的两倍哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "187bcc34c0bf1657fff0a3ba90c14a13691cfbce92f948dd9053ab6efa7a4fed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:627e5bea259d8af75045ac51",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "【画着可爱剪刀手图案的便签】\\n自主训练结束了哦！成果，你要来看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6b5edafec4ec974095a0cb6fc79db597ce0ba44a0afcf48752025693d53bcb2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04d15e9b971030664eff1c4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你这家伙，太不敬了。要让本王等到何时。\\n自主训练什么的早就完成了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874a713de1e3caadedb8304d25f1c7657d820fb036b72f30ce65f314bc8e9e91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf58a71035892ed9b6422506",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练早就做完啦。来，还不快点\\n过来？让你见识一下变得更加强韧的我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83008808e72c7ac3d2e8803fa5286d12457065a896f530edeb86f644f99b21b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9ecc1b4cd979c9028f0401",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然自主训练结束了，但我的实力还远远不足。\\n为了超越“那个家伙”……请您多多指导！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ee30e04629882148eba3834acb89c633eafd4f597f8b2a3d5218d756fdc863b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13afeb06cb639d9df579c95b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。自主训练已经结束。\\n请下达接下来的指示。",
      "source_fingerprint": "403daa3c994f2942e206909ee75f3f693de09e55cee16c7044021825cdde0b68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73abd313ce808f130688d6ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "差不多，到了您有空的时候了吧？\\n我也刚好……结束了自主训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1be5234a874eef480daa6188c2bac74ab646144f8c5709ec3495ac294e2951b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a599630f01b890bccbc4f80c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没关系吗。再不快点来的话，结束了自主训练的我\\n可就要回去睡觉然后醒来再次开始自主训练了哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "27ea08ebe7d6155fe6c58320900d3f199ed4f9ff9fb6bf79e23fc6eb74bf6540",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5dd96a0e11c17ec5d22e0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望向主君展示自主训练的成果。\\n敢问……那个，大概何时，能与您相见呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "74b70af6f9079affb841bfd2a75e377fa052f448ae9a8c7e71841bd9ed0cd52e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08c63c48fe692e447adc08f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练虽然完成了，但还不够痛快呢。\\n接下来要做什么？无论什么我都会做给你看的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e81c5cbcff1c876432811624a44ecf0a0b67179f7a2642de952eff9e637027e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad0a6b02fd44ae3de6c4005",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "报告，自主训练已结束！我也准备好了报告书，\\n请您签名盖章！",
      "source_fingerprint": "061079000e5b92a504253f0f12645e73f96a3a5c3253b372074e57b9c37afbfb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:106353de01052988ca03c3dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练虽然结束了……但还有孩子在跑着呢。\\n接下来——就由我和你一起去超越她们吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "631531ccfff62aafb7f376e0166333edde5286960d06cc237c9923638a5502c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:721e8764fbce4e7c969448ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练做完了，能来看看我的成果吗？\\n一起来慢慢让花蕾绽放吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f37cf39d9b72675af8d947991f4606dc77ee1e1d92648c8cebfe565fee5c19f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b11f2289c2c61af98e1f42f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕！而且还达成了我珍藏的\\n专属规则！如果不介意的话请来听我说说吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21559b264bb62fe6ad3bef5136aa30e50e3664976578e407f15bb39de2585828",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:873f52cab5e78ee59f33cf20",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了，要不要稍微开个会？\\n讨论一下关于如何用我们的奔跑传递更多爱的方法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec0defbe2ed5922060e46ac1d7acc91b89ed631ed390aa46aee17d0c90892f2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6cfa0d50d6814cc32923989",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕。在休息的时候，下一场要观战的赛事\\n的预测也完成了……如果不介意的话，您愿意听听吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "222b4561ce0d60e8fe979b0e6455c93ca3f88ac9be37a21fcb244d36b41adf2e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28777fb02f7c84605894256f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练，结束了。请下达下一个指示——\\n为了能扎起那束荣光的花束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d44a4570f860d1502f832f257bf7ff32e678ccabc0669625893ded792eb78c37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f61c3cbeddefb517a947e55a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕，好啦。下一段旅途你也一起来如何？\\n准备得这么充分，我向你保证一定会是一段美妙的旅程的",
      "source_fingerprint": "d964e4d3434912402d30159ad1811c4b737af13b4ebf7730e5dfc31b1c934328",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98581e0ff3c158bf4b8352a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练做完了，我打算做一下祈祷。\\n圣女的光辉……如果不介意的话，您要来看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dbe4dee59b5d6b18b4003fda84f4a3a35a7c5a776496e6ba15c6771e11c41fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82c5ae9dbc98ad030027809a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "【广受好评连载中】自主训练完毕了！\\n结束了修行篇的我的实力，请务必来确认一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f0e380ad3c5f9dc67656062415577d7f27a1c5fe3a6c4fe9240035e5e4682ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c3245afbe7c046228dcf7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦！来，接下来呢？\\n我可是一直在等着你的指示呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "723b17d170c3cc323e2a58c9bb7790311763764490dd79fac3028342afe56199",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89a3d55855394028e99e9e20",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您能来确认一下自主训练的成果吗？如果又成功\\n编织出了一丝希望……我想只展现给您看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2605e735fb10d79e7476b93730343f16a0a6c8d891d7f80f00c0a23d1972dfa1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb056b16badfec54e976c6b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束。虽然我一个人也绰绰有余……\n但正因为有你的协助，我才能去争取更进一步的优势，不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f91678f8fc70a370ec97893433f45ebb9370371339b5cc814e4c357d85a166",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1145"
      ]
    },
